<title>USA: Patriot American sets special $0.06/shr div.</title>
<headline>Patriot American sets special $0.06/shr div.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said on Thursday that it had set a special dividend of $0.06 per share to distribute earnings and profits from its merger with California Jockey Club and Bay Meadows Operating Co.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on June 30 to shareholders of record on June 27, the hotel real estate investment trust said in a statement.</p>
